                            <ul class="text-sm text-gray-300 space-y-1">
                                <li>• Azure Functions (Python runtime)</li>
                                <li>• Azure Cosmos DB (NoSQL)</li>
                                <li>• Azure Storage Queues</li>
                                <li>• Azure Functions Core Tools</li>
                                <li>• Azurite for local emulation</li>
                                <li>• Visual Studio Code integration</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-4">
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-100 mb-3">External Integration</h3>
                            <ul class="text-sm text-gray-300 space-y-1">
                                <li>• SendGrid Email API</li>
                                <li>• SMTP notifications</li>
                                <li>• REST API endpoints</li>
                                <li>• JSON serialization</li>
                                <li>• Environment configuration</li>
                                <li>• Secure credential management</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-4">
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-100 mb-3">Development Tools</h3>
                            <ul class="text-sm text-gray-300 space-y-1">
                                <li>• Python 3.8+</li>
                                <li>• Git version control</li>
                                <li>• Local development environment</li>
                                <li>• Azure Functions extension</li>
                                <li>• Function testing framework</li>
                                <li>• Performance monitoring tools</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </ProjectSection>

                <!-- Performance Analysis & Evaluation -->
                <ProjectSection Title="Performance Analysis & Scalability Testing" Subtitle="How the serverless workflow performed and how far it scaled" Icon="fas fa-chart-line">
                    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">Performance Metrics</h3>
                            <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-4 mb-4">
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-100 mb-2">Runtime Analysis</h4>
                                <ul class="text-sm text-gray-300 space-y-1">
                                    <li>• Function execution times</li>
                                    <li>• Cold start vs warm start performance</li>
                                    <li>• Database operation latency</li>
                                    <li>• End-to-end workflow timing</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                            <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-4">
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-100 mb-2">Resource Consumption</h4>
                                <ul class="text-sm text-gray-300 space-y-1">
                                    <li>• CPU utilization</li>
                                    <li>• Memory usage and optimization</li>
                                    <li>• Network I/O performance</li>
                                    <li>• Storage operation efficiency</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">Scalability Investigation</h3>
                            <div class="space-y-3">
                                <div class="border-l-4 border-line pl-4">
                                    <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-100">Function Invocation Testing</h4>
                                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-300">I raised the number of concurrent function calls step by step to find the scaling limits.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="border-l-4 border-line pl-4">
                                    <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-100">Load Distribution Analysis</h4>
                                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-300">How the workflow performed under different loads.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="border-l-4 border-line pl-4">
                                    <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-100">Serverless Advantages</h4>
                                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-300">An assessment of auto-scaling, fault tolerance and how simple the system is to operate.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </ProjectSection>

                <!-- Advanced Features & Innovation -->
                <ProjectSection Title="Features" Subtitle="Serverless patterns and distributed system design in practice" Icon="fas fa-lightbulb">
                    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">Event-Driven Architecture</h3>
                            <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-4 mb-4">
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-100 mb-2">Database Change Triggers</h4>
                                <ul class="text-sm text-gray-300 space-y-1">
                                    <li>• Watches the Cosmos DB change feed</li>
                                    <li>• Generates low-stock alerts automatically</li>
                                    <li>• Tracks inventory thresholds in real time</li>
                                    <li>• Event-sourced notifications</li>
                                </ul>
